Haven — https://github.com/amarisaster/Haven
================================================================

Haven
Originally developed by amarisaster. Licensed under Apache License 2.0.
Haven does not distribute a NOTICE file of its own.

Haven's dual-transport MCP client — Streamable HTTP with SSE fallback —
was ported into Aerie and is still in the tree, carrying its provenance in
its own file header. It serves two live paths: the phone's MCP settings
screen, and the API router runtime, which needs its tools handed over as
schemas plus an executor rather than loaded from a config file. It does not
serve Aerie's warm CLI lanes — those load their own servers and the backend
never sees those connections, a limitation Aerie documents rather than
works around.

